  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Accumulated damage to ports, docks and coastal logistics increases delivery times, rebuild costs and permits for hyperscale sites, causing developers and cloud providers to delay or cancel planned AI compute and data-center investments in the impacted supply corridors.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">ai_economic_shift</data>
</edge>
