  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">Physical damage to berths, cranes and hinterland connections directly reduces available berthing and handling capacity until repairs are completed or alternate facilities are brought online.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">shipping_chokepoints</data>
