  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher on‑hand and pipeline availability of GPUs/accelerators and other critical parts immediately enables more training and inference jobs to be scheduled and provisioned, increasing actual compute-cycle consumption and utilization intensity.</data>
