  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter US-China tech/trade restrictions that reduce the availability of key electronic components (IMUs, GNSS receivers, RF modules, MCUs) directly degrade Russian production and repair of guided drones and cruise/loitering munitions, lowering strike sortie and attrition-sustaining rates.</data>
