  <data key="d37">Higher rates of capital deployment into AI physical infrastructure fund on-site logistics contracts and terminal automation (cranes, electrification, IT links) at ports serving heavy hardware flows, directly increasing handling throughput and hinterland connectivity.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
