  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Increased AI infrastructure investment finances regional data centers, local inventory buffers and AI-enabled logistics routing systems that diversify suppliers and enable faster recovery from disruptions, improving overall resilience.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_economic_shift</data>
