  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained higher freight rates raise landed costs and compress near-term margins for AI hardware vendors and hardware-dependent AI firms, leading investors to mark down valuation multiples.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">shipping_chokepoints</data>
  <data key="d40">ai_economic_shift</data>
