  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained increases in freight rates raise operating costs and shorten ROI horizons for just‑in‑time logistics, prompting private investors to mobilize capital into warehousing, regional production, and alternative logistics projects.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">shipping_chokepoints</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_trade</data>
