  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher usable port capacity disperses shipping and staging across more terminals and berths, lowering the concentration of high-value targets and thereby reducing the incentive and opportunities for adversaries to launch drones/missiles at a few predictable facilities.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">shipping_chokepoints</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
